<title>CANADA: Johnson &amp; Johnson names CFO.</title>
<headline>Johnson &amp; Johnson names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson &amp; Johnson said Thursday it named Robert Darretta as vice president of finance and chief financial officer, and a member of the company's executive committee.</p>
<p>Darretta succeeds Clark Johnson, who died March 13.</p>
<p>His appointment is effective immediately and he will report to Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Ralph Larsen, J&amp;J said. Darretta has been treasurer and a corporate officer of Johnson &amp; Johnson since May 1995.</p>
